# TextFSM template for `show ip arp` on Cisco Catalyst 2950 EI.
# AGE is the "Age (min)" column ("-" for the device's own SVI entry).
# Verified: IOS 12.1(22)EA9, WS-C2950G-48-EI.
Value IP (\d+\.\d+\.\d+\.\d+)
Value AGE (\S+)
Value MAC ([0-9a-fA-F]{4}\.[0-9a-fA-F]{4}\.[0-9a-fA-F]{4})
Value INTERFACE (\S+)

Start
  ^Internet\s+${IP}\s+${AGE}\s+${MAC}\s+\S+\s+${INTERFACE}\s*$$ -> Record
